                                              "deputyFormTypes[{formTypeName, formType, checked}], isAgentSign}; files as file0..",
        "Sort": "index of the leave type in AvailableLeave Data + 2 (what the web form sends)",
        "PUT  LeaveRequestForms/Delete/{id}": "withdraw a form (unverified; use `mayo raw`)",
